---
source: tests/surface_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(&[])"
---
Authors and validates notes in a governed markdown vault

Usage: mnemex <COMMAND>

Commands:
  new         Mint a note
  set         Set a field
  rename      Retitle a note, every spoke `project` that names a renamed project, and every body link that names it
  delete      Remove a note
  adopt       Bring an existing markdown file into the vault
  check       Check a note or a whole vault
  schema      Print the schema. This is the schema
  hook        Read a tool-event payload on stdin and report on the write
  list        List every note, including one whose frontmatter does not parse
  resolve     Find a note by id
  project     Find the project that owns a directory
  show        What a note belongs to: its project and its project's spokes
  brief       The one command a session runs at start
  skill       Print the embedded agent skill, or install or check the installed one
  extension   Print an embedded hook, or install or check the installed one
  completion  Print the shell-completion activation snippet
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
